{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07871","headline":"除夜有怀 · 孟浩然","name":"除夜有怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"五更钟漏欲相催，四气推迁往复回。\n帐里残灯才去熖，炉中香气尽成灰。\n渐看春逼芙蓉枕，顿觉寒销竹叶杯。\n守岁家家应未卧，相思那得梦魂来。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟浩然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07871.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07871","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}